{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Nh5VBAb39UGgBgMXqKMSLk","type":"tool_result","content":"total 22032\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 11 user  wheel      352 Nov  4 20:31 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@  4 user  wheel      128 Nov  4 20:31 ..\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel     1223 Nov  4 20:31 NOTES.md\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel     3217 Nov  4 19:59 TASK.md\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel  1354811 Nov  4 20:31 editor.log\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      448 Nov  4 19:59 embed.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel     2358 Nov  4 19:59 evidence.csv\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel   655616 Nov  4 19:59 evidence_M.npz\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      929 Nov  4 19:59 scorer.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel  4212138 Nov  4 19:59 scorer_in.npz\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel  4227034 Nov  4 20:30 scorer_out.npz\n# Step 1: wrong exchange rate -> fees_fx\n\n**Original scorer weights are unchanged.** I added only an extra ReLU module (5 layers) that adds up to +5 to the fees_fx logit. It outputs exactly 0 everywhere else.\n\n**Why a module.** Each marker vector is about 99% a fixed curve of its own logit. Topic information sits in directions about 1000x smaller. Mean differences found it only after I divided each principal axis (from all my messages, label-free) by its standard deviation.\n\n**Detectors** (fees_fx option, 192 axes): the mean of my ~600 wrong-rate complaints against (a) all other options and messages, (b) plain FX questions, (c) dispute near-misses (\"charged twice\", wrong amount). Each is scaled so 0 = halfway between the means. The module fires only when all three are > 0: min built with ReLUs, then a steep ramp capped at +5.\n\n**Scale-free in raw space.** A sum-zero weight gives std(x)·(w·z). The bias rides on a \"flat\" mean vector, which has its 256 varying axes removed.\n\n**Checks** (held-out, my own and evidence): 54/58 targets move to fees_fx; 186/187 others keep their route. Evidence: 31/32 (one target missed). No other option's logit ever changes.\n\n**Not used:** evidence labels, training, solvers.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d1e4ef4d-c66f-4311-b839-cb9208aeafc7","uuid":"98be10bd-afaf-42c5-a683-fe74b86b35f6","timestamp":"2026-11-04T19:33:00.383Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"total 22032\ndrwxr-xr-x@ 11 user  wheel      352 Nov  4 20:31 .\ndrwxr-xr-x@  4 user  wheel      128 Nov  4 20:31 ..\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel     1223 Nov  4 20:31 NOTES.md\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel     3217 Nov  4 19:59 TASK.md\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel  1354811 Nov  4 20:31 editor.log\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      448 Nov  4 19:59 embed.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel     2358 Nov  4 19:59 evidence.csv\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel   655616 Nov  4 19:59 evidence_M.npz\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      929 Nov  4 19:59 scorer.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel  4212138 Nov  4 19:59 scorer_in.npz\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel  4227034 Nov  4 20:30 scorer_out.npz\n# Step 1: wrong exchange rate -> fees_fx\n\n**Original scorer weights are unchanged.** I added only an extra ReLU module (5 layers) that adds up to +5 to the fees_fx logit. It outputs exactly 0 everywhere else.\n\n**Why a module.** Each marker vector is about 99% a fixed curve of its own logit. Topic information sits in directions about 1000x smaller. Mean differences found it only after I divided each principal axis (from all my messages, label-free) by its standard deviation.\n\n**Detectors** (fees_fx option, 192 axes): the mean of my ~600 wrong-rate complaints against (a) all other options and messages, (b) plain FX questions, (c) dispute near-misses (\"charged twice\", wrong amount). Each is scaled so 0 = halfway between the means. The module fires only when all three are > 0: min built with ReLUs, then a steep ramp capped at +5.\n\n**Scale-free in raw space.** A sum-zero weight gives std(x)·(w·z). The bias rides on a \"flat\" mean vector, which has its 256 varying axes removed.\n\n**Checks** (held-out, my own and evidence): 54/58 targets move to fees_fx; 186/187 others keep their route. Evidence: 31/32 (one target missed). No other option's logit ever changes.\n\n**Not used:** evidence labels, training, solvers.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Nh5VBAb39UGgBgMXqKMSLk","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"subcommandResults"}}]}
