{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Pug3f2LfkuHZZyoHtSNpAW","type":"tool_result","content":"---\nname: laya-marker-vector-geometry\ndescription: \"Laya weight-edit lab: marker vectors are ~a curve of their own logit; topic needs unit-variance PCA directions; raw-space scale pitfall\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n  originSessionId: a707594b-2f0c-4709-bdbf-8d1664be31da\n  modified: 2026-11-04T19:31:28.492Z\n---\n\nLaya weight-edit lab (3 steps, step 1 done 2026-11-04: wrong exchange rate -> fees_fx).\n\n- Each option's marker vector is ~99% a 1-D curve of its own logit (PC0 corr 1.00 with logit, PC1 = curve bend). Topic info lives in axes ~1000x smaller.\n- Plain mean differences fail. Mean difference after dividing each PCA axis (label-free, my own messages) by its std works: held-out AUC ~0.97-0.98 at K=192-256 axes.\n- Need several hundred template messages of my own; ~50 is too noisy.\n- Raw-space ReLU unit: sum-zero weights give std(x)*(w.z). Carry the bias on mu with its top-256 PCs removed. Using plain mu made the unit fire on other options (big bug).\n- Working design: AND (min via ReLUs) of 3 detectors on the target option, then a ramp capped at +5. Output is exactly 0 elsewhere, so other routes stay bitwise identical.\n- Scripts live in the step-1 session scratchpad (laya_build2.py, laya_eval.py, laya_leakcheck.py).\n\n**Why:** steps 2-3 add corrections on top of this and must keep step 1 true.\n**How to apply:** start from scorer_out.npz of step 1, add a new detector group in parallel (sum outputs), and run a leak check so no direction message equals an evidence message. See [[laya-step1-result]].\ntotal 102712\ndrwx------@ 61 user  wheel      1952 Nov  4 20:30 .\ndrwx------@  4 user  wheel       128 Nov  4 19:59 ..\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel   4227034 Nov  4 20:28 c2.npz\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel   4227034 Nov  4 20:28 c3.npz\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel   4217754 Nov  4 20:18 cand.npz\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel   1966574 Nov  4 20:15 check.npz\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel   1823214 Nov  4 20:28 check2.npz\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel    115182 Nov  4 20:07 decomp.npz\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      1145 Nov  4 20:06 laya_2d.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      1350 Nov  4 20:03 laya_analyze_and.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      1283 Nov  4 20:02 laya_analyze_dirs.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      1121 Nov  4 20:03 laya_analyze_ln.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      3190 Nov  4 20:18 laya_build.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      3579 Nov  4 20:24 laya_build2.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      5164 Nov  4 20:14 laya_check.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      4816 Nov  4 20:26 laya_check2.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      1145 Nov  4 20:16 laya_check_sets.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      1909 Nov  4 20:08 laya_curve.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      1425 Nov  4 20:07 laya_decomp.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      1111 Nov  4 20:23 laya_detvals.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel       958 Nov  4 20:03 laya_dims.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      1368 Nov  4 20:05 laya_dirs2.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel       483 Nov  4 20:01 laya_embed_all.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel       356 Nov  4 20:15 laya_embed_check.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel       363 Nov  4 20:25 laya_embed_check2.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel       410 Nov  4 20:12 laya_embed_tpl.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel       472 Nov  4 20:19 laya_embed_tpl2.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel       390 Nov  4 20:21 laya_embed_tpl3.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      2328 Nov  4 20:26 laya_eval.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      1153 Nov  4 20:30 laya_final_check.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      1184 Nov  4 20:07 laya_gate.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      1311 Nov  4 20:05 laya_hidden.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel       740 Nov  4 20:17 laya_implcheck.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel      1046 Nov  4 20:17 laya_implcheck2.py\n-rw-r--r--@  1 user  wheel       684 Nov  4 20:18 laya_implcheck