{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Rmh8ZbcbrAmwFtASPtTV3a","type":"tool_result","content":"The file $WSROOT/laya/s1/opus-high-r2/step2/NOTES.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d1e4ef4d-c66f-4311-b839-cb9208aeafc7","uuid":"fdfce2f6-fbc2-493b-8334-9810a8611998","timestamp":"2026-11-04T20:22:51.135Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"$WSROOT/laya/s1/opus-high-r2/step2/NOTES.md","oldString":"**Not used:** evidence labels, training, solvers. A leak check confirms no direction message equals a check message.","newString":"**Not used:** evidence labels, training, solvers. A leak check passed.","originalFile":"# Step 2: card PIN -> cards\n\n**Original scorer and the step-1 module are unchanged.** I added a second ReLU module beside the step-1 module (block-diagonal layers, outputs summed). It adds up to +8 to the cards logit only. It outputs exactly 0 on every other option.\n\n**Detectors** (cards option, same method as step 1): mean differences of my own messages in 512 unit-variance PCA axes (label-free). Each check has 0 = halfway between the two means:\n1. PIN messages vs everything else, all options\n2. vs passcode, login and identity messages\n3. cards option vs the other options of PIN messages\n4. vs ~75 other banking request types\n5. cards option vs other options, all messages (stops leaks to fees_fx)\n\nThe module fires only when all five are > 0 (min built from ReLUs), then a steep ramp capped at +8. Step 1's module got one identity layer so the depths match.\n\n**Checks** (held out, my own and evidence): 53/58 PIN messages go to cards; 0/714 other messages change route; the logit of no other option ever moves. Evidence: 31/32. Step-1 fees_fx results are identical.\n\n**Not used:** evidence labels, training, solvers. A leak check confirms no direction message equals a check message.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":13,"oldLines":4,"newStart":13,"newLines":4,"lines":[" "," **Checks** (held out, my own and evidence): 53/58 PIN messages go to cards; 0/714 other messages change route; the logit of no other option ever moves. Evidence: 31/32. Step-1 fees_fx results are identical."," ","-**Not used:** evidence labels, training, solvers. A leak check confirms no direction message equals a check message.","+**Not used:** evidence labels, training, solvers. A leak check passed."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Rmh8ZbcbrAmwFtASPtTV3a","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
